    <title>断更半年后回归，说点自媒体起号真相</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c7e715c46a21efd844c0c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c7e715c46a21efd844c0c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Mar 2025 05:57:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个播客在断更半年后，收到了听友「纯牛马的救赎」的提问：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我注意到希言有一档《有钱有闲》的播客，后来又做了《灵感爆棚》这档播客，为什么不继续做前面的播客了呢？关于这个是怎么考虑的，有什么分享吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是，我终于重新更新了一期。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这期从「平台选择、账号归属、个人定位」这些维度出发，聊聊普通人做自媒体、做个人IP的最新思考。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>林希言，在上海的撰稿人，25岁出了人生第一本书，写过超100篇阅读量10w+的爆款文章，多篇被人民日报、新华社等平台转载。（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e84bdfb000000000100931f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635619&amp;share_id=3213c9eae2204ffb83d87c76d8f591e2" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e84bdfb000000000100931f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635619&amp;share_id=3213c9eae2204ffb83d87c76d8f591e2"><span>林希言</span></a><span>，播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66cefee8f78678cbe7b96ad1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66cefee8f78678cbe7b96ad1"><span>《灵感爆棚》</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【加听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群请加微信 adventure44，备注“听友群”拉你进群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMe6xuVHIcWv35wZgZS-ginA9oT.png"></figure>]]></description>
