  <item>
    <title>29岁从央视裸辞做自媒体，同事都说我疯了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dc78d0ee04007d88dd17b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dc78d0ee04007d88dd17b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Sep 2024 16:01:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾——绿泥泥，曾在《新闻联播》做编辑，给康辉递过稿子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>29岁那年，她从中央电视台裸辞。不仅自己不上班，孩子也没上学。她带着全家在全国旅居，走过19个城市。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多人怀疑她家里有矿，也有人问她是不是发大财了，其实都不是。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们会聊聊她做出这些选择背后的真实心路历程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也厌倦了一成不变的生活，想要探索更多的可能性，这期节目一定会给你勇气和力量。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：在《新闻联播》工作，是种什么体验？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 辞职后才发现，根本挣不到以前的工资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 干新闻，不像《新闻女王》里那样高大上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 见了太多名人，也就脱敏了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 每个员工，都是定点螺丝钉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 你的每时每刻，都被别人严丝合缝地安排好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 离职时，同事都觉得我疯了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：带着全家去旅居，在人生旷野里撒欢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 旅居的日常，就是不断折腾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 从很爽到焦虑，只用了半年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 未来充满不确定性，所以不敢停下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 以前工作时9点起床，离职后5点起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 跟市场短兵相接，才发现赚钱比上班还难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 宝妈最容易被骗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 很多不切实际的需求，只有骗子才能满足</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3：聊聊自媒体搞钱的野路子和心法</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 最重要的，是要有网感，把目标人群圈得足够明确</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 本质上你只能吸引想成为你的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 放弃做育儿博主的背后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 定位是试出来的，不是空想出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 搞钱之城义乌探险记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 链接老板的超绝方法，竟然是用boss直聘？（一整个震惊）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 带着全家旅居，要花多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">44:04</a> 做自媒体越简单越好，太难的话坚持不下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 摆地摊和送快递，最终目的也是为了做自媒体</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期主播】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>林希言，在上海的撰稿人，25岁出了人生第一本书，写过超100篇阅读量10w+的爆款文章，多篇被人民日报、新华社等平台转载。小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e84bdfb000000000100931f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635619&amp;share_id=3213c9eae2204ffb83d87c76d8f591e2" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e84bdfb000000000100931f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635619&amp;share_id=3213c9eae2204ffb83d87c76d8f591e2"><span>林希言</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>绿泥泥，《新闻联播》裸辞，带娃旅居19个月。边旅行边搞钱，现在回北京村里，开了个200平的小红书工作室。小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59f57c74e8ac2b2536523963?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635387&amp;share_id=ecdde60181a3419e9f2113d0240a3082" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/59f57c74e8ac2b2536523963?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5e84bdfb000000000100931f&amp;apptime=1725635387&amp;share_id=ecdde60181a3419e9f2113d0240a3082"><span>绿泥泥</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【加听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群请加微信 jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音），备注“听友群”拉你进群哦。也可以找我领取超干货小红书实操ppt，主打不藏私。</span></p><span></span><p><span>林希言 微信：jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FochvhDcq5oiC8h_QMWOB4DqLzZD.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luzn35fyjhHYObafFt2xbJDFadYv.m4a" length="107290151" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQ3GVrQ85L5moLTiBqcxQdaUre2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>打工人下班后搞副业：不妨「先做一个垃圾出来」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cb48d7ead5fc3792544b7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cb48d7ead5fc3792544b7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期的嘉宾——绿子，是一名98年女孩，也是一名播客主。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩都在上海，也都是一边工作一边做自媒体。作为资深i人，她在做播客过程中，都经历了什么？又踩过哪些坑？为什么我们共同认为做「个人IP」，是普通人为数不多的翻身机会？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天就来跟大家聊一聊。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期时间轴】</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 ：做自媒体，真的能赚到钱吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 播客全平台涨粉6000+，有收入么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 做自媒体怎么应对「数据焦虑」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 分享欲，比什么都重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 从零开始做账号，怎么定位？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 为什么不建议裸辞做自媒体</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 ：下班后做自媒体，怎么坚持下来？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 播客vs小红书vs视频，怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 影响小红书流量的2个关键点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 不管做哪个平台，能坚持下来最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 拖延的本质，可能是「诱惑不够」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 播客快速涨粉，可以悄咪咪做这些动作</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 ：赚钱，是需要学习的技能</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> 要想接广告，一定要注重评论区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 想做好播客，音质太重要了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 一心赚快钱的话，播客肯定不是好选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 播客是最小单元的副业，i人友好版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 赚钱是一个可以习得、可以学习的技能</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期主播】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>林希言，在上海的撰稿人，25岁出了人生第一本书，写过超100篇阅读量10w+的爆款文章，多篇被人民日报、新华社等平台转载。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>绿子，产品经理，通过剪播客找音乐同好，做最爱跳jazz的播客主，追求体验和高能量的ISFP。全网同名：摇摆小绿</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/614576175d30916e9a891aa9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/614576175d30916e9a891aa9"><span>摇摆时间</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e440967000000000100203d?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5e440967000000000100203d&amp;apptime=1724596351" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e440967000000000100203d?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5e440967000000000100203d&amp;apptime=1724596351"><span>摇摆小绿</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>【找到主播】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>加听友群请加微信 jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音），备注“听友群”拉你进群哦。也可以找我领取超干货小红书实操ppt，主打不藏私。</span></p><span></span><p><span>林希言 微信：jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FochvhDcq5oiC8h_QMWOB4DqLzZD.png"></figure>]]></description>
