    <guid isPermaLink="false">656ed2c2f6f2b065f0b00345</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Dec 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么我们明明那么努力，却赚不到钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活中为什么有那么多「高认知穷人」？</span></p><span></span><p><span>金钱羞耻、不好意思谈钱，背后是怎样的心理机制？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们为什么不好意思“卖自己”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有哪些突破金钱卡点的实用干货？</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 我们为什么不敢谈钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 不敢收钱，其实是怕承担责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 排斥钱的人，注定很难赚到钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 什么是知识的诅咒？该如何打破？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 带着成就对方的初心去销售</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 为爱发电很难持久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 筛选客户，而非贪多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 把心态从“求别人”变成“帮别人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 潜意识的限制性理念，导致很多人不敢变富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 因上努力，果上随缘</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们好呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是林希言，一名写作者，目前居住在上海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客是我的独白，聊聊怎么看待「钱」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群请加微信 jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音），备注“听友群”拉你进群哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMMXHHCnVFILwmvdDjRQHn6WU5K.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>林希言 微信：jijianxiezuo（极简写作 的谐音）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的星球：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLQfw5nv7LV0___kLjZWHt4le19.png"></figure>]]></description>
